  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary check button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Manual check action; disabled while checking, loading, or showing an offline copy.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg>Verificar cupões</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand,#e10916);color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#bd0712}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-primary{transition:background-color 120ms ease-out}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Date reset button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Underlined date-filter reset action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text-button\">Limpar data</button>",
      "css": ".ds-text-button{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;min-height:44px;border:0;background:transparent;text-decoration:underline;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);cursor:pointer}.ds-text-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-text-button{transition:background-color 120ms ease-out}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Native labeled select for account filtering and the next manual check.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\">Conta<select class=\"ds-field\"><option>Todas as contas</option><option>Conta 1</option><option>Conta 2</option><option>Conta 3</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:11.25px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-field{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#272326);border:1px solid #cdbfc2;border-radius:6px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 34px 10px 12px;max-width:100%;cursor:pointer}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Store selector",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "store-circle",
      "description": "Scrollable store filter with official local logos, visible names, and an accessible pressed state. This illustrative sample selects Continente and shows its new-coupon dot; it is not a live coupon report.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-store-selector\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filtrar por loja\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-store-button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Continente: novos cupões\"><span class=\"ds-store-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"ds-store-logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><image width=\"32\" height=\"32\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-store-new\"></span></span><span>Continente</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-store-button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Galp\"><span class=\"ds-store-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"ds-store-logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"110\" height=\"55\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 55\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><image width=\"110\" height=\"55\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"/></svg></span><span>Galp</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-store-button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Wells\"><span class=\"ds-store-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' class=\"ds-store-logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"300\" height=\"109.2\" viewBox='0 0 10 3.64'><path fill='#008eaa' d='M9.99 2.25a.47.47 0 01-.08.2c-.18.26-.65.8-1.3.83-.55.03-.64-.16-.66-.2a.45.45 0 010-.2c.02-.06.04-.12.06-.12.06 0 .16.12.35.12a.47.47 0 00.42-.37c.06-.32-.26-.4-.38-.71l-.09.17a4.25 4.25 0 01-.33.52.24.24 0 01-.02.05c-.14.19-.55.8-1.06.82-.24 0-.34-.19-.37-.42-.2.22-.48.45-.78.47-.3.01-.38-.28-.39-.58-.23.27-.64.62-1.15.64-.75.04-1-.38-1.01-.74-.24.43-.56.82-.96.84-.42.02-.58-.37-.64-.8-.24.44-.57.85-.98.87-.8.03-.63-1.72-.55-2.4V1.2c.03-.08.17-.1.33-.1.25-.02.32.01.3.08-.01.35-.17 2.06.13 2.04.26 0 .65-.95.77-1.42.02-.1.13-.11.21-.11h.14c.25-.02.3.01.3.08-.02.34-.16 1.4.14 1.38.26 0 .65-.94.77-1.42.03-.1.18-.1.27-.11h.07c.09 0 .12.02.11.08a3.89 3.89 0 01-.1.32 1.47 1.47 0 01.93-.4c.33-.02.79.14.72.5-.08.39-.49.6-.9.63a1.26 1.26 0 01-.42-.06c.01.25.2.36.46.34.47-.02.78-.26 1.08-.64l.02-.12c.05-.4.2-1.16.27-1.53.07-.33.64-.34.58-.04l-.32 1.63-.04.23c-.05.24-.05.43.06.42.14 0 .35-.2.57-.45 0-.17.03-.3.03-.31.06-.4.24-1.01.3-1.34.07-.37.59-.37.54-.16-.04.23-.18.88-.3 1.56l-.05.23c-.05.24-.05.43.07.42.12 0 .3-.16.5-.38.08-.1.33-.4.48-.7.11-.21.43-.74.6-.75.14 0 .2 0 .2.07-.1.46.56.63.45 1.22a.7.7 0 01-.2.35c.3-.12.52-.36.75-.67.03-.04.03-.06.06-.06.05 0 .06.12.04.23m-5.35-.03c.04-.18-.1-.23-.24-.22-.23 0-.46.22-.54.48.04.01.12.02.21.01.23 0 .54-.08.57-.27'/></svg></span><span>Wells</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-store-selector{display:flex;gap:24px;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;padding:24px 8px 12px;margin-inline:-8px;scrollbar-width:thin}.ds-store-button{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;flex:0 0 auto;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;min-width:84px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-store-circle{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:76px;height:76px;border:2px solid var(--line,#e6dadd);border-radius:50%;background:#fff;font-size:16.5px}.ds-store-logo{display:block;max-width:60%;max-height:48%}.ds-store-button:hover .ds-store-circle{border-color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-store-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-store-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .ds-store-circle{border:3px solid var(--brand,#e10916);background:var(--brand-soft,#fff0f1)}.ds-store-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px}.ds-store-new{box-sizing:border-box;position:absolute;top:5px;right:2px;width:12px;height:12px;border:2px solid #faf8f8;border-radius:50%;background:#893b23}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-store-selector{gap:12px}.ds-store-button{min-width:80px}.ds-store-circle{width:64px;height:64px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-store-button{transition:background-color 120ms ease-out}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "View navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-tab",
      "description": "Three views use a ruled selected state; this sample shows Cupões selected.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Vistas dos cupões\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-selected\" aria-current=\"page\">Cupões</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Comparar contas</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Histórico</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e6dadd)}.ds-tab{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;min-height:44px;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);padding:12px 0;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab:hover{color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-tab.ds-selected{color:var(--ink,#272326);border-bottom-color:var(--ink,#272326);font-weight:700}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{gap:22px;width:100%;justify-content:space-between}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-tab{transition:background-color 120ms ease-out}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "New offer badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-new",
      "description": "Informational badge; it has no hover or interactive state.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-new\">Novo</span>",
      "css": ".ds-new{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:10.2px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;color:#bd0712;background:#fff0f1}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Expiry badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-urgent",
      "description": "Written urgency label accompanies the amber treatment; it is not a control.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-urgent\">Expira em 48h</span>",
      "css": ".ds-urgent{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:10.2px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--amber,#795004);background:var(--amber-bg,#fff4d4)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared account strip",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "account-strip",
      "description": "Three summaries share one pale red surface. Sample labels are illustrative, not a live account report.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-accounts\" aria-label=\"Estado das contas\"><div class=\"ds-account\"><div class=\"ds-account-title\"><h2 class=\"ds-account-name\">Conta 1</h2><span class=\"ds-connection\">Por ligar</span></div><p class=\"ds-account-time\">Última verificação: <strong class=\"ds-account-date\">Ainda não verificada</strong></p></div><div class=\"ds-account\"><div class=\"ds-account-title\"><h2 class=\"ds-account-name\">Conta 2</h2><span class=\"ds-connection\">Por ligar</span></div><p class=\"ds-account-time\">Última verificação: <strong class=\"ds-account-date\">Ainda não verificada</strong></p></div><div class=\"ds-account\"><div class=\"ds-account-title\"><h2 class=\"ds-account-name\">Conta 3</h2><span class=\"ds-connection\">Por ligar</span></div><p class=\"ds-account-time\">Última verificação: <strong class=\"ds-account-date\">Ainda não verificada</strong></p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-accounts{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));background:var(--brand-soft,#fff0f1);color:var(--ink,#272326);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.ds-account{padding:22px 26px;min-width:0}.ds-account+.ds-account{border-left:1px solid #e5d1d5}.ds-account-title{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.ds-account-name{font-size:16.5px;margin:0}.ds-connection{font-size:10.8px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--amber,#795004)}.ds-connection:before{content:\"\";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.ds-account-time{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);margin:8px 0 0}.ds-account-date{font-weight:400;color:var(--ink,#272326)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-accounts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ds-account{padding:20px}.ds-account+.ds-account{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #e5d1d5}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ruled offer row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "offer-row",
      "description": "Illustrative offer with discount, identity, native disclosure, and a mobile-visible status.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-offer-row\"><div class=\"ds-discount\"><strong class=\"ds-discount-value\">10%</strong><span class=\"ds-discount-caption\">em cartão</span></div><div class=\"ds-offer\"><div class=\"ds-offer-labels\"><span class=\"ds-brand\">Continente</span><span>Conta 1</span></div><h3 class=\"ds-offer-title\">Oferta de exemplo</h3><details class=\"ds-details\"><summary class=\"ds-summary\">Condições e imagem original</summary><p class=\"ds-details-copy\">As condições e a imagem original aparecem aqui quando disponíveis.</p></details></div><div class=\"ds-validity\"><span class=\"ds-status-label\">Disponíveis</span><strong>Até 10 nov. 2026</strong><small class=\"ds-validity-start\">Desde 4 nov. 2026</small></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-offer-row{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px minmax(0,1fr) 170px;gap:24px;padding:26px 20px 26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e6dadd);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e6dadd);background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-discount{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:7px 12px 0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-discount-value{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.035em;white-space:nowrap}.ds-discount-caption{font-size:10.8px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);text-align:center}.ds-offer{min-width:0}.ds-offer-labels{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10.8px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-brand{font-size:11.25px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-offer-title{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;text-wrap:balance}.ds-summary{font-size:11.25px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);padding:10px 0;min-height:36px;list-style-position:inside;cursor:pointer}.ds-summary:hover{color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-details-copy{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);margin:0;padding:8px 0}.ds-validity{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;font-size:12px;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-status-label{color:var(--muted,#6d6164);font-size:10.5px}.ds-validity-start{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-offer-row{grid-template-columns:78px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;padding:20px 12px 20px 0}.ds-discount{padding:4px 8px}.ds-discount-value{font-size:24.75px;white-space:normal}.ds-offer-title{font-size:13.8px}.ds-validity{grid-column:2;align-items:flex-start;gap:3px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account comparison",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "comparison-heading",
      "description": "Illustrative comparison repeats account names on mobile and distinguishes an unverified account.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-comparison\"><div class=\"ds-compare-row ds-compare-heading\"><span>Oferta e validade</span><span>Conta 1</span><span>Conta 2</span><span>Conta 3</span></div><div class=\"ds-compare-row\"><div class=\"ds-compare-offer\"><span class=\"ds-compare-brand\">Continente</span><h3 class=\"ds-compare-title\">Oferta de exemplo</h3><small class=\"ds-compare-small\">4 nov. 2026 — 10 nov. 2026</small></div><div class=\"ds-compare-value\"><span class=\"ds-mobile-account\">Conta 1</span><span><strong class=\"ds-compare-discount\">10%</strong><small class=\"ds-compare-small\">Disponível</small></span></div><div class=\"ds-compare-value\"><span class=\"ds-mobile-account\">Conta 2</span><small class=\"ds-compare-small\">Por verificar</small></div><div class=\"ds-compare-value\"><span class=\"ds-mobile-account\">Conta 3</span><small class=\"ds-compare-small\">Por verificar</small></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-comparison{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-compare-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(3,clamp(96px,12vw,160px));gap:24px;padding:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e6dadd)}.ds-compare-heading{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);padding:12px 24px;background:var(--brand-soft,#fff0f1)}.ds-compare-brand{font-size:11.25px;font-weight:700}.ds-compare-title{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:5px 0;text-wrap:balance}.ds-compare-small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-compare-value{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-compare-discount{font-size:24px}.ds-compare-value .ds-compare-small{display:block}.ds-mobile-account{display:none}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-compare-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));overflow-wrap:anywhere;gap:14px;padding:20px 16px}.ds-compare-offer{grid-column:1/-1}.ds-compare-heading{display:none}.ds-mobile-account{display:block;font-size:11.25px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-compare-row{animation:ds-arrive 160ms ease-out}@keyframes ds-arrive{from{background:#fff0f1}to{background:transparent}}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "History record",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "history-row",
      "description": "Illustrative account-filtered event row with native before-and-after disclosure.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-history-row\"><time class=\"ds-history-time\">4 nov., 09:00</time><div><div class=\"ds-history-labels\"><span class=\"ds-history-kind\">Cupão alterado</span><span>Conta 1</span></div><h3 class=\"ds-history-title\">Oferta de exemplo</h3><p class=\"ds-history-copy\">Continente · 10% · até 10 nov. 2026</p><details><summary class=\"ds-history-summary\">Ver alteração</summary><dl class=\"ds-history-diff\"><dt>Antes</dt><dd>5% · Oferta de exemplo</dd><dt>Depois</dt><dd>10% · Oferta de exemplo</dd></dl></details></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-history-row{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e6dadd);color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-history-time{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-history-labels{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;font-size:10.8px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);margin-bottom:6px}.ds-history-kind{font-size:11.25px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-history-title{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;text-wrap:balance}.ds-history-copy{font-size:12px;margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#6d6164)}.ds-history-summary{font-size:11.25px;color:var(--muted,#6d6164);padding:10px 0;min-height:36px;list-style-position:inside;cursor:pointer}.ds-history-summary:hover{color:var(--ink,#272326)}.ds-history-summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #860711;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-history-diff{font-size:12px;margin:16px 0}.ds-history-diff dt{color:var(--muted,#6d6164);margin-top:8px}.ds-history-diff dd{margin:2px 0;color:var(--ink,#272326);overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-history-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Offline notice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The saved-copy timestamp stays visible when the Mac is unreachable; this is an illustrative state.",
      "html": "<p role=\"status\" class=\"ds-offline\">Sem ligação ao Mac. A mostrar a cópia guardada em 5/11, 09:00. Os cupões podem ter mudado.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-offline{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:12.75px;line-height:1.55;padding:15px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--amber-bg,#fff4d4);color:var(--amber,#795004)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Weekly shopping planner",
    "overview": "CC Cupões is a Portuguese operational dashboard for checking coupon records before shopping. Its Continente-red navigation, pale red account strip, and white offer rows make account ownership and usable dates easy to scan. Manrope gives the interface a consistent, restrained voice.\n\nThe implemented system uses alignment, horizontal rules, and clear text states. Discount values lead each offer; account identity, conditions, and validity stay close. The account comparison preserves the same offer identity across columns.\n\nThis document records `dashboard/src/App.jsx` and `dashboard/src/style.css`, with the direction contract in `index.html` (seed `25aafe48`) and product constraints in `PRODUCT.md`. It describes implemented presentation, not successful external account authentication or Telegram delivery.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Continente-red navigation and a pale red account status strip.",
      "Self-hosted Manrope throughout the working interface.",
      "Ruled offer rows with large discount values and explicit dates.",
      "Portuguese account, status, comparison, and history labels.",
      "Flat surfaces with visible keyboard focus and restrained motion."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Written State Rule",
        "body": "Always retain the state label beside a status color or dot, including on mobile.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Offer Identity Rule",
        "body": "Keep each offer's title and validity together when its account values move between desktop and mobile layouts.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep Portuguese operational labels and Europe/Lisbon date context consistent.",
      "**Do** place account identity, written status, and validity near each offer.",
      "**Do** preserve visible status and account labels when columns collapse on mobile.",
      "**Do** use horizontal rules and aligned values to organize repeated records.",
      "**Do** keep unknown values and unverified account states explicit.",
      "**Do** retain native fields, disclosures, visible focus, and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** turn every offer into a floating, shadowed card.",
      "**Don't** communicate connection or expiry state through color alone.",
      "**Don't** replace original offer evidence with invented discount values or decorative imagery.",
      "**Don't** treat an account without a successful check as confirmed to have no offers.",
      "**Don't** present configured Telegram settings as verified notification delivery."
    ]
  }
}
